          "body": "- **Das geht.** = That works. That's fine.\n- **leider** = unfortunately. It makes a *no* polite.\n- **vielleicht** = maybe\n\nTo say you can't make it, start with the day: **Am Montag kann ich leider nicht.** The verb is still second!",
